Role Summary and Impact &nbsp;

As part of the Global Operations Centre (GOC) , you will work closely with teams across the United States, Europe, and Asia to deliver high-impact solutions in a collaborative, multicultural environment. We are looking for an Manager who will:

• Process execution and operational ownership: Execute approved staffing processes across demand intake, capacity review, allocation, deployment, bench management, reporting and escalations. Translate direction into actions, owners and deadlines, ensuring accurate systems, clear handoffs and operational coverage.

• Demand fulfillment and allocation management: Fulfill confirmed demand by balancing client needs, skills, seniority, availability, utilization and employee development. Approve routine allocations, resolve scheduling conflicts and ensure effective deployment of available resources.

